{"seq":2,"slug":"marketing-accrual","title":"营销费用计提/对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-marketing-budget-management/marketing-finance-review/marketing-accrual","wordCount":2211,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"营销费用计提-对账\">营销费用计提/对账</h1><p>营销团队月底说「花了 3200 万」，财务从系统里拉出来的发票只有 2400 万。差额不是因为有人算错，而是因为<strong>这两件事在回答不同的问题</strong>。本文讲营销费用怎么计提、管理口径与财务口径的差异怎么产生、以及每个月怎么把它们调节到一起——并且留下经得起审计的记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-权责发生制-vs-现金-发票口径\">核心概念：权责发生制 vs 现金/发票口径</h2><p>会计的基本原则是<strong>权责发生制（accrual basis）</strong>：费用在它被「消耗」的期间确认，而不是在付款或收到发票的期间确认。营销费用在这件事上特别典型。</p>\n<p>一个 8 月的投放，8 月 25 日投放完成，广告平台 9 月 5 日出账单，9 月 20 日付款，发票 10 月才开。按权责发生制，这笔费用属于<strong>8 月</strong>——因为 8 月的收入是靠这次投放带来的。如果等到 10 月发票到才入账，8 月的报表会显示营销费用偏低、利润虚高，10 月则会突然多出一笔。</p>\n<p><strong>计提（accrual）就是为了解决这个错配：在没有发票、没有账单的时候，先按估计入账，后续再调整。</strong> 营销费用是计提最重的科目之一，因为它金额大、发生频繁、且结算周期与业务周期严重错位。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>确认时点</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>管理口径</td>\n<td>事件发生日</td>\n<td>投放系统 + 归集事实表</td>\n<td>近似（估算+快照）</td>\n<td>决策、监控、止损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务计提</td>\n<td>期间末</td>\n<td>归集事实表 + 在途承诺</td>\n<td>中（估算后调整）</td>\n<td>期间损益确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发票/结算口径</td>\n<td>发票或结算单到达</td>\n<td>上游账单</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最终入账、审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的关系是<strong>逐级收敛</strong>：管理口径 → 计提口径 → 结算口径，后一级是对前一级的修正。<strong>关键设计决定是：三者必须都可查且可调节，绝不能用一个口径覆盖另一个。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"计提的四类费用来源\">计提的四类费用来源</h2><p>营销费用不是一类东西，计提方式各不相同。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类：已发生已结算（媒体花费）。</strong> 广告平台有日结账单的最简单——用账单金额入账，账单没到的部分用投放系统消耗估算。<strong>估算与最终账单的差额在账单到达期间调整。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第二类：已发生未结算（affiliate 佣金）。</strong> 这是计提的典型场景。佣金在订单成交时产生，但结算要等下个账期，且有无效订单冲回。计提方式是按订单成交额与合同费率计算预提：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Accrual</mtext><mtext>affiliate</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mtext>成交订单于 </mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>费率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>预期无效比例</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Accrual}_{\\text{affiliate}}(t) = \\sum_{\\text{成交订单于 } t} \\text{GMV} \\times \\text{费率} \\times (1 - \\text{预期无效比例})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Accrual</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">affiliate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">成交订单于</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">费率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预期无效比例</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>预期无效比例</code> 从历史数据估计（通常 3%–12%，因品类与渠道而异）。<strong>这个比例必须定期重估</strong>，否则会系统性高估或低估费用。</p>\n<p><strong>第三类：券与补贴。</strong> 券的成本确认有两次：<strong>发行时按预期核销率预提</strong>，<strong>核销时精确确认</strong>，<strong>过期时反冲未被核销的预提</strong>。三次动作缺一不可。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>issued</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>est</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>发行预提</mtext></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>issued</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>est</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>redeemed</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>核销调整与过期反冲</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_t = \\underbrace{N_{\\text{issued}} \\cdot V \\cdot p_{\\text{est}}}_{\\text{发行预提}} \\;-\\; \\underbrace{(N_{\\text{issued}} \\cdot V \\cdot p_{\\text{est}} - N_{\\text{redeemed}} \\cdot V)}_{\\text{核销调整与过期反冲}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2041em;vertical-align:-1.5208em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4792em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">发行预提</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">issued</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">est</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5208em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">核销调整与过期反冲</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">issued</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">est</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">redeemed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是张数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是面额、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>est</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{est}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">est</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预期的核销率。<strong>如果只做发行预提而不做过期反冲，券的费用会永远虚高</strong>——因为总有一部分券永远不会被核销。</p>\n<p><strong>第四类：内部与工具成本。</strong> 营销团队的薪酬、SaaS 工具、代理服务费。这些通常按月固定，直接按发生额入账，但<strong>是否计入渠道 ROI 需要明确的政策</strong>（见 <a href=\"../spend-aggregation/spend-normalize-currency\">多币种花费归一与口径统一</a>中的全成本讨论）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[期间开始] --&gt; B[媒体花费&lt;br/&gt;账单+估算]&#10;    A --&gt; C[affiliate 佣金&lt;br/&gt;成交订单 x 费率 x 1-无效率]&#10;    A --&gt; D[券补贴&lt;br/&gt;发行预提]&#10;    A --&gt; E[内部/工具成本&lt;br/&gt;固定发生额]&#10;    B --&gt; F[期间计提合计]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[入账 8 月损益]&#10;    H[期间结束] --&gt; I[收到账单/结算单]&#10;    I --&gt; J[计提 vs 实际差异]&#10;    J --&gt; K{差异归因}&#10;    K --&gt; L1[时滞差: 自然收敛, 期间调整]&#10;    K --&gt; L2[口径差: 解释并调节]&#10;    K --&gt; L3[真实差错: 追溯更正]&#10;    K --&gt; M[差异调节表]&#10;    L1 --&gt; M&#10;    L2 --&gt; M&#10;    L3 --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; N[审计轨迹]\">graph TD\n    A[期间开始] --&gt; B[媒体花费&lt;br/&gt;账单+估算]\n    A --&gt; C[affiliate 佣金&lt;br/&gt;成交订单 x 费率 x 1-无效率]\n    A --&gt; D[券补贴&lt;br/&gt;发行预提]\n    A --&gt; E[内部/工具成本&lt;br/&gt;固定发生额]\n    B --&gt; F[期间计提合计]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[入账 8 月损益]\n    H[期间结束] --&gt; I[收到账单/结算单]\n    I --&gt; J[计提 vs 实际差异]\n    J --&gt; K{差异归因}\n    K --&gt; L1[时滞差: 自然收敛, 期间调整]\n    K --&gt; L2[口径差: 解释并调节]\n    K --&gt; L3[真实差错: 追溯更正]\n    K --&gt; M[差异调节表]\n    L1 --&gt; M\n    L2 --&gt; M\n    L3 --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; N[审计轨迹]</pre><h2 id=\"管理口径与财务口径的差异-三个来源\">管理口径与财务口径的差异：三个来源</h2><p>两张报表对不上时，差异必须被归因到具体来源，否则调节就是「凑数」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异来源</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n<th>会自然收敛吗</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据成熟时滞</td>\n<td>8 月管理口径 100 万，9 月看是 108 万</td>\n<td>会</td>\n<td>期末快照 + 差异期间调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>口径定义差</td>\n<td>管理口径含税，财务按不含税</td>\n<td>不会</td>\n<td>显式调节表，长期稳定存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率差</td>\n<td>管理用日终中间价，财务用结算汇率</td>\n<td>不会</td>\n<td>汇兑损益科目吸收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途承诺</td>\n<td>投放已发生但未进账单</td>\n<td>会</td>\n<td>计提包含在途，账单到达时冲回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实差错</td>\n<td>采集丢数据、映射错误</td>\n<td>不会</td>\n<td>追溯更正 + 排查根因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>「会自然收敛」与「不会」是两类完全不同的差异，必须分开处理。</strong> 时滞差在数据成熟后会消失，只要当时的快照在，差异就自动解释；口径差与汇率差是结构性的，会一直存在，必须有一个稳定的调节表把两者桥接起来。</p>\n<p>调节表的标准形态是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>财务费用</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>管理花费</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>口径差</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>汇率差</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>时滞差（当期）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>差错更正</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{财务费用} = \\text{管理花费} + \\text{口径差} + \\text{汇率差} + \\text{时滞差（当期）} + \\text{差错更正}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">财务费用</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">管理花费</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">口径差</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">汇率差</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时滞差（当期）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">差错更正</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每一项都应有独立的可下钻明细。<strong>如果一个平台不能把管理口径与财务口径的差额分解到这几类，它的财务对账就永远只能靠人工凑数。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"在途承诺-计提里最容易被漏掉的一项\">在途承诺：计提里最容易被漏掉的一项</h2><p>第一章第 1 篇讲过 <code>in_flight_reserved</code> 是可动用余额的组成部分；在计提里它有同样的地位。<strong>已发生但未进账单的花费必须被计提，否则期间费用会被系统性低估。</strong></p>\n<p>在途承诺的识别有两种途径。<strong>途径一：来自投放系统。</strong> 投放系统知道它发起了多少投放、预计消耗多少。这是最直接的来源，但投放系统的预估值可能不准。<strong>途径二：来自账单的残缺部分。</strong> 账单只覆盖到某一天，之后的部分用消耗接口补。</p>\n<p><strong>在途承诺必须有到期时间。</strong> 一笔 8 月的在途承诺，如果到 11 月还没变成账单，那它要么是投放没真正发生（应释放），要么是采集出了问题（应排查）。系统应当对超过预期结算周期的在途承诺告警——<strong>长期挂账的在途承诺是数据质量问题的信号，不是正常的会计余额。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"审计轨迹-四个必须回答的问题\">审计轨迹：四个必须回答的问题</h2><p>营销费用是审计重点关注的对象，因为它金额大、易被操纵、且估算成分高。一个可审计的计提系统必须能回答：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>需要的记录</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>这笔费用是什么？</td>\n<td>预算节点 ID + 渠道类型 + 上游源引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>什么时候确认的？为什么是这个期间？</td>\n<td><code>occurred_at</code> + 权责期判定依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额怎么来的？</td>\n<td>计算方式（账单/估算/预提公式）+ 依据数据快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后来改过吗？改成什么了？</td>\n<td>完整调整历史，含调整原因与审批人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第三条最容易被忽略。</strong> 一个计提金额如果是估算的，必须记录估算方法与当时用的参数（例如「按历史核销率 62% 预提」）。三个月后审计问「为什么 8 月预提了 620 万」，答案必须是「当时的预期核销率是 62%，依据是 7 月末的历史数据快照 <code>snap_xx</code>」，而不是「系统算的」。</p>\n<p><strong>估算方法的变更也必须留痕。</strong> 如果 9 月把预期核销率从 62% 改成 55%，这是一个影响期间费用的会计估计变更，必须单独记录并说明原因。<strong>不记录估算参数变更的系统，在审计时无法解释为什么同一批券在两个月的单位成本不同。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>权责发生制要求费用在消耗期间确认；计提解决「业务发生」与「账单到达」之间的时滞错配。</li>\n<li>四类费用来源计提方式不同：媒体（账单+估算）、affiliate（成交额×费率×无效折扣）、券（发行预提→核销精确→过期反冲三步）、内部成本（固定发生额）。</li>\n<li>管理口径与财务口径的差异分三类：时滞差（会收敛，靠期末快照解释）、口径差与汇率差（结构性，靠调节表桥接）、差错（追溯更正）。</li>\n<li>在途承诺必须计入计提，且必须有到期时间与超期告警；长期挂账是数据质量问题而非正常余额。</li>\n<li>审计轨迹要能回答「是什么/何时确认/怎么算的/改过什么」，尤其必须记录估算方法与估算参数变更的历史。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"营销费用计提/对账","id":"营销费用计提-对账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：权责发生制 vs 现金/发票口径","id":"核心概念-权责发生制-vs-现金-发票口径"},{"level":2,"text":"计提的四类费用来源","id":"计提的四类费用来源"},{"level":2,"text":"管理口径与财务口径的差异：三个来源","id":"管理口径与财务口径的差异-三个来源"},{"level":2,"text":"在途承诺：计提里最容易被漏掉的一项","id":"在途承诺-计提里最容易被漏掉的一项"},{"level":2,"text":"审计轨迹：四个必须回答的问题","id":"审计轨迹-四个必须回答的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"活动 ROI 复盘与下轮分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-marketing-budget-management/marketing-finance-review/campaign-roi-review"},"next":{"title":"各市场预算效率对标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-marketing-budget-management/marketing-finance-review/budget-efficiency-benchmark"}}